@startuml
title ASUC-04: Carbon-Aware Forecast Refresh with Deadline Override
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
actor "Kubernetes CronJob" as Tick
control "Carbon-Aware Controller" as Ctrl
participant "Simulated Carbon Feed" as Carbon
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
control "Existing Forecast Adapter" as Worker
participant "Prometheus Metrics" as Metrics
Tick -> Ctrl : Start scheduled tick
Ctrl -> DB : Claim due jobs idempotently; read deadline_at
DB --> Ctrl : Due jobs + last forecast timestamps
Ctrl -> Carbon : Read simulated gCO2e/kWh
Carbon --> Ctrl : Intensity or missing signal
loop Each due laptop
  alt Deadline reached (priority)
    Ctrl -> Worker : Force forecast despite intensity
  else Intensity <= 300 gCO2e/kWh
    Ctrl -> Worker : Forecast in low-intensity window
  else High intensity and time remains
    Ctrl -> DB : Persist DEFER and next check (< deadline)
  else Signal missing
    Ctrl -> DB : Record signal error, apply fail-safe retry
    opt Deadline critical
      Ctrl -> Worker : Execute
    end
  end
  opt Forecast executed
    Worker -> DB : Read validated history; upsert forecast/model/time
    DB --> Worker : Stored / error
  end
  Ctrl -> Metrics : Duration, job state, kWh and estimated gCO2e
end
Ctrl --> Tick : Batch completion summary
note over Ctrl,Worker
  Deadline forces an execution attempt, not guaranteed success.
  Measurement compared against immediate-run baseline.
end note
@enduml
